1
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:29,250
[Live Forever]

2
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:32,950
[Episode 11]

3
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:43,210
What brings you here

4
00:00:43,210 --> 00:00:44,360
today?

5
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,670
I've been wearing this gold bean

6
00:00:54,670 --> 00:00:56,750
since I was born.

7
00:00:58,030 --> 00:00:59,350
My mom told me

8
00:00:59,350 --> 00:01:01,030
if it weren't for a savior

9
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,960
who blocked the car for her back then,

10
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,040
I wouldn't have had the chance

11
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:05,370
to come into this world.

12
00:01:06,950 --> 00:01:07,870
This gold bean

13
00:01:08,350 --> 00:01:10,280
was also given to me by that savior.

14
00:01:10,770 --> 00:01:13,030
Later, we always wanted to see her again,

15
00:01:13,070 --> 00:01:14,600
but we could never find her.

16
00:01:23,039 --> 00:01:24,120
If you came to see me today

17
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:26,640
to tell a story from before you were born,

18
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:27,710
I might…

19
00:01:27,710 --> 00:01:29,560
But how could she not be found?

20
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:32,310
Could it be

21
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,120
that she used a fake identity?

22
00:01:44,150 --> 00:01:45,759
It's strange, too.

23
00:01:46,130 --> 00:01:48,729
The impact of that car crash
back then was huge,

24
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,640
yet she survived.

25
00:01:58,950 --> 00:01:59,710
Song Yiqiu.

26
00:02:01,310 --> 00:02:03,110
Why does the person in this photo

27
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:05,120
look exactly like you?

28
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:17,840
There are

29
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,910
plenty of people in this world
who look alike.

30
00:02:19,910 --> 00:02:21,240
You don't actually think

31
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:23,120
that I'm your savior, do you?

32
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,150
Right.

33
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:31,790
There really are a lot of people
who look alike.

34
00:02:37,990 --> 00:02:40,060
Lately, some fragmented images

35
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,120
that don't belong to this era

36
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:44,430
have inexplicably kept appearing

37
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:47,240
in my mind.

38
00:02:48,910 --> 00:02:50,910
At first, I thought they were dreams

39
00:02:51,079 --> 00:02:52,210
or hallucinations.

40
00:02:53,030 --> 00:02:54,960
But it wasn't until I saw this photo

41
00:02:55,620 --> 00:02:58,220
that I realized
they weren't hallucinations.

42
00:02:58,630 --> 00:03:00,960
And I'm not just Lin Huai
of this lifetime.

43
00:03:01,990 --> 00:03:03,780
We knew each other before.

44
00:03:04,630 --> 00:03:05,470
You even

45
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,840
saved me in a past life.

46
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:12,240
Do you really not remember any of it?

47
00:03:14,190 --> 00:03:15,660
There's a sniper. Go!

48
00:03:20,410 --> 00:03:21,870
Don't stick your head out.

49
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:22,750
They didn't succeed.

50
00:03:22,750 --> 00:03:23,710
They'll come for you again.

51
00:03:23,710 --> 00:03:24,800
Run!

52
00:03:25,230 --> 00:03:26,350
Run!

53
00:03:26,370 --> 00:03:27,900
No, I'm not leaving.

54
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,320
You're awake?

55
00:03:57,590 --> 00:03:58,630
That student.

56
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,520
Is he still alive?

57
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,570
Don't worry.

58
00:04:02,870 --> 00:04:03,670
He's not dead.

59
00:04:06,590 --> 00:04:07,360
That's good.

60
00:04:08,030 --> 00:04:09,160
I'll go check on him.

61
00:04:17,950 --> 00:04:18,680
Who is he?

62
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:21,260
Is he worth it for you, Song Yiqiu,

63
00:04:23,180 --> 00:04:24,510
actually, Song Baiwei,

64
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:27,040
to have your heart pierced through

65
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:29,040
and your lungs shredded by bullets,

66
00:04:29,450 --> 00:04:31,710
yet still worry about his life and death?

67
00:04:37,310 --> 00:04:38,710
I can't explain it to you.

68
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:44,360
If I hadn't arrived fast enough,

69
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:46,390
you and that student
would be dead already.

70
00:04:46,390 --> 00:04:46,950
And

71
00:04:47,270 --> 00:04:48,510
all the reporters in Shanghai

72
00:04:48,510 --> 00:04:49,720
are waiting outside Ning Mansion

73
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:51,560
to see how your wound healed

74
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,220
and how you rose from the dead.

75
00:04:53,310 --> 00:04:53,950
You put yourself

76
00:04:53,950 --> 00:04:55,600
under everyone's flashbulbs.

77
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,600
You'll be dissected like a monster.

78
00:04:58,190 --> 00:04:59,800
In these three thousand years,

79
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,830
haven't you suffered enough for this?

80
00:05:01,830 --> 00:05:03,190
The land was torn apart.

81
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,870
Dynasties changed.

82
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,640
Haven't you seen enough?

83
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:08,890
Can you really save so many people?

84
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,320
I can't save them all.

85
00:05:13,910 --> 00:05:15,860
But I'll save as many as I can.

86
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:23,680
It's because I've seen too much death

87
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:26,510
that I know how precious it is to live.

88
00:05:27,930 --> 00:05:29,460
You used to be like this too.

89
00:05:31,950 --> 00:05:32,880
You've changed.

90
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:43,510
That Ning Changyue

91
00:05:45,430 --> 00:05:46,490
can't protect you.

92
00:05:54,730 --> 00:05:56,090
Starting today,

93
00:05:57,370 --> 00:05:58,430
you will stay here.

94
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,930
You are not allowed to go anywhere.

95
00:06:02,320 --> 00:06:03,530
You want to lock me up?

96
00:06:09,210 --> 00:06:10,670
It's for your protection.

97
00:06:25,170 --> 00:06:26,930
Extra! Extra!

98
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:28,900
Commander Ning
kills five innocent patrol officers

99
00:06:28,900 --> 00:06:31,100
in a fit of rage to protect his wife.

100
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:33,000
Extra! Extra!

101
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,420
Commander Ning
kills…

102
00:06:50,070 --> 00:06:51,630
I want to see Commander Ning!

103
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:52,890
Sorry, you can't go in.

104
00:06:53,390 --> 00:06:54,680
Calm down. You can't go in!

105
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,920
Let me in!

106
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:56,720
Commander,

107
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:59,220
Patrol Officer Chen Gensheng's family
won't leave.

108
00:06:59,220 --> 00:06:59,900
Let her in.

109
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,600
I'll handle the family.

110
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:01,950
You don't need to…

111
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:02,600
Let her in.

112
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,000
Yes, Sir.

113
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,800
Commander Ning!

114
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,920
You can't go in. You really can't.

115
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:07,850
Commander Ning!

116
00:07:08,750 --> 00:07:09,630
Let her in.

117
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:10,750
Here.

118
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:17,650
Commander Ning.

119
00:07:17,970 --> 00:07:20,320
What the newspaper says isn't true, is it?

120
00:07:21,220 --> 00:07:22,860
That day, my son

121
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:26,000
was just following the order
to disperse the students.

122
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:26,750
He…

123
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:29,510
He didn't even carry a gun.

124
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:31,190
He didn't do anything wrong.

125
00:07:31,730 --> 00:07:34,000
He didn't kill anyone.

126
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,409
Commander Ning, I beg you.

127
00:07:36,710 --> 00:07:38,220
I beg for your mercy.

128
00:07:39,190 --> 00:07:41,650
-Please release him.
-Give her the pension.

129
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,750
Pension?

130
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:45,510
No!

131
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:47,580
My son is not dead!

132
00:07:47,610 --> 00:07:49,200
He's still in prison!

133
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:50,150
Give her double.

134
00:07:51,390 --> 00:07:53,040
I don't want money!

135
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,800
I want my son!

136
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,360
I want my son!

137
00:07:56,750 --> 00:07:58,680
Give me back my son!

138
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,750
You killed my son!

139
00:08:00,750 --> 00:08:02,310
You butcher!

140
00:08:02,310 --> 00:08:04,360
I want you to die a horrible death!

141
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,360
I'll take you down with me!

142
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:08,630
Granny!

143
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:09,950
Granny!

144
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,360
Granny!

145
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:14,830
Take her to the hospital! Hurry!

146
00:08:14,890 --> 00:08:15,400
Somebody!

147
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:16,040
Hurry!

148
00:08:17,390 --> 00:08:18,070
Granny.

149
00:08:20,270 --> 00:08:20,800
Let's go.

150
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:21,850
Take it slow.

151
00:08:23,070 --> 00:08:23,750
Be careful.

152
00:08:25,510 --> 00:08:26,840
To the hospital. Hurry!

153
00:08:42,230 --> 00:08:43,830
How many times has this been?

154
00:08:45,530 --> 00:08:46,900
[Commander Ning
kills five innocent patrol officer]

155
00:08:46,900 --> 00:08:48,280
[in a fit of rage to protect his wife]

156
00:08:48,430 --> 00:08:49,880
What is this now?

157
00:08:56,150 --> 00:08:57,240
Explain.

158
00:08:58,340 --> 00:09:00,000
Explain that you didn't know.

159
00:09:02,390 --> 00:09:04,450
Explain that you did so to protect me.

160
00:09:04,610 --> 00:09:06,090
Explain that they were in the wrong,

161
00:09:06,090 --> 00:09:08,000
and you just did the right thing.

162
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,440
Explain it!

163
00:09:18,910 --> 00:09:21,170
I'm investigating who tried to kill you.

164
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,720
They obviously came prepared.

165
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:23,870
It's very dangerous.

166
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:24,320
So I must…

167
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,250
Very dangerous.

168
00:09:27,060 --> 00:09:29,790
So you'd rather kill
these five innocent people.

169
00:09:31,060 --> 00:09:31,940
Ning Changyue.

170
00:09:33,510 --> 00:09:34,600
Now you've climbed step by step

171
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:36,200
to the position you wanted.

172
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:39,030
These five lives mean nothing to you,

173
00:09:39,030 --> 00:09:40,550
just ants, is that it?

174
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,150
Commander Ning.

175
00:09:45,030 --> 00:09:46,720
Treating human lives like weeds.

176
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,150
Abusing your power.

177
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:51,550
Is this your so-called protection?

178
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,210
Where are you going?

179
00:10:28,670 --> 00:10:29,670
I'm leaving here.

180
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,390
It's very dangerous outside right now.

181
00:10:31,390 --> 00:10:32,120
At any moment, you could…

182
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:32,750
Die,

183
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:36,060
or be treated as an immortal monster?

184
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,180
Ning Changyue.

185
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,550
I'm not afraid of these.

186
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:47,000
What I'm afraid of is
that you let more people

187
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:49,730
die under your power
in the name of protecting me.

188
00:10:56,330 --> 00:10:57,190
Ning Changyue.

189
00:10:59,370 --> 00:11:01,430
If I had known I would end up like this,

190
00:11:01,970 --> 00:11:04,770
I would rather have died
in Southern Qin back then.

191
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:29,010
[Tomb of Mr. Chen Gensheng]

192
00:11:56,390 --> 00:12:00,380
[Tomb of Ms. Song Baiwei]

193
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:14,150
Turn it over.

194
00:12:24,630 --> 00:12:25,390
Song…

195
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:27,010
Baiwei?

196
00:12:48,790 --> 00:12:49,790
It really is you.

197
00:12:51,270 --> 00:12:52,240
You were shot in the heart.

198
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,840
You couldn't have survived.

199
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:54,790
Are you

200
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:56,270
a human

201
00:12:57,030 --> 00:12:58,480
or a ghost?

202
00:12:59,970 --> 00:13:01,060
Did you erect this?

203
00:13:06,260 --> 00:13:07,810
Song Baiwei.

204
00:13:07,910 --> 00:13:10,320
I didn't expect
that in your few short decades of life,

205
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:12,050
someone would sincerely

206
00:13:12,750 --> 00:13:14,210
erect a tombstone for you.

207
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:16,890
That's nice.

208
00:13:33,680 --> 00:13:34,760
Apples are okay.

209
00:13:35,690 --> 00:13:36,780
I don't like pears.

210
00:13:49,610 --> 00:13:52,020
You came to visit a grave
with just a newspaper?

211
00:13:52,020 --> 00:13:53,680
Are you trying to fool a ghost?

212
00:13:54,390 --> 00:13:55,390
No, no, no.

213
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:57,580
That day, I thought you were dead.

214
00:13:57,630 --> 00:13:58,510
In your briefcase,

215
00:13:58,510 --> 00:14:00,120
I saw your name, Song Baiwei,

216
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:01,200
and the sketches.

217
00:14:01,630 --> 00:14:02,360
Then,

218
00:14:02,740 --> 00:14:04,340
I sent them to the newspaper.

219
00:14:04,670 --> 00:14:05,510
Take a look.

220
00:14:23,870 --> 00:14:24,790
It's him.

221
00:14:34,630 --> 00:14:36,240
Thank you, Lin.

222
00:14:36,630 --> 00:14:37,670
I didn't expect these drawings

223
00:14:37,670 --> 00:14:39,730
to end up being sent to the newspaper.

224
00:14:40,270 --> 00:14:41,080
It's nothing.

225
00:14:41,790 --> 00:14:42,910
My pleasure.

226
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:53,000
I'll repay your kindness

227
00:14:53,350 --> 00:14:54,710
in my next life.

228
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:04,980
Since you think I'm already dead,

229
00:15:06,390 --> 00:15:07,790
then I'll just be a ghost.

230
00:15:15,550 --> 00:15:18,100
[One month later]

231
00:15:19,740 --> 00:15:21,050
Excuse me. Excuse me.

232
00:15:25,470 --> 00:15:26,380
Miss, do you need a ride?

233
00:15:26,380 --> 00:15:27,510
It's cheap and fast.

234
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:33,000
To the newspaper office.

235
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:34,390
Okay. Let's go.

236
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:41,720
Thank you.

237
00:15:52,510 --> 00:15:53,080
Miss.

238
00:15:53,790 --> 00:15:55,720
Do ghosts have to pay for a ride too?

239
00:15:58,900 --> 00:15:59,850
Song Yiqiu.

240
00:16:00,270 --> 00:16:02,200
I've already guessed your secret.

241
00:16:03,150 --> 00:16:04,360
But in my heart,

242
00:16:04,710 --> 00:16:05,950
you will always be Song Baiwei.
